  "description": "ShapeCrawler (formerly SlideDotNet) is a .NET library for manipulating PowerPoint presentations. It provides fluent APIs to process slides without having Microsoft Office installed.\nThis library provides a simplified object model on top of the Open XML SDK for manipulating PowerPoint documents without any COM+ or COM interop layers.",
